WEBVTT

00:00.150 --> 00:01.609
Dust, smoke and us.

00:02.309 --> 00:10.796
This is everything fine enough to hang in the air: desert dust, smoke from fires, salt from the sea, and the haze of cities and industry.

00:11.246 --> 00:15.693
Dust from the Sahara crosses the Atlantic and feeds the Amazon.

00:16.143 --> 00:21.616
The gas that warms the planet most, carbon dioxide, does not show here at all.

00:22.066 --> 00:24.905
It is invisible, and it is everywhere.
